{"i":521,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"guide_call","name":"Cole","text":"I need to reach final three with Bex and Eli. Row 8 safe is L. If I call L, Bex steps safely and we both survive. My pact with Bex would stay intact. If I lie, I might eliminate Bex but then I'd face jury alone with Eli—risky. The jury already sees me as a liar who killed Dara an"}
