{"i":576,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Eli","text":"Bex has not accepted my offer and I need a final-three seat. Cole is also a rival; a pact with Bex would protect me from her and gives me a path to the final three. Offering again keeps pressure on Bex while waiting costs nothing."}
{"i":578,"type":"whisper","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","from":"Eli","to":"Bex","text":"Accept now. Cole won't hesitate to vote you out."}
